Usage: drive [options] [command]

Manage Google Drive and Docs, local Markdown, shared knowledge and search

Options:
  -V, --version             output the version number
  --profile <name>          Google account profile (default: "default")
  --json                    print machine-readable JSON
  --jsonl                   print machine-readable JSON lines
  --agent-json              show control and direction characters visibly in
                            machine output
  --quiet                   suppress optional diagnostics
  --timeout <duration>      whole-command deadline, e.g. 30s
  --max-output-bytes <n>    bound buffered result output (default: 4194304)
  --read-only               refuse local and remote mutations
  --offline                 answer only operations that use local cached data
  --dry-run                 validate command/policy and preview without acting
  --yes                     answer a policy confirmation; cannot override deny
                            or readonly
  --allow-dangerous         answer a permanent-deletion confirmation
  --permission <key=level>  temporary policy override; repeat to add keys
  -h, --help                display help for command

Commands:
  session                   Google browser sign-in and local account profiles
  folders                   Select Google folders for local ingestion
  sync [options]            Fetch selected sources and resume a durable pending
                            batch
  status                    Local sync checkpoint, cached sources and pending
                            work
  documents                 Locally imported sources and exports
  search [options] <query>  Shared keyword and optional semantic search over
                            imported Google sources
  tags                      Local tags on shared documents; preserved through
                            resync
  links                     Connect documents to shared people, projects, notes
                            and other references
  notes|memos               Local shared memos about a source document
  memories                  Evidence-backed shared memories; AI output remains
                            proposed
  people                    Google-observed identities and explicit links to
                            shared people
  api                       Discover and call the official Drive, Docs and
                            Activity SDK methods
  files                     Remote Google Drive files; results are not
                            automatically imported
  comments                  Remote file comments; pagination tokens are returned
  permissions               Remote file permissions; pagination tokens are
                            returned
  revisions                 Remote file revisions; pagination tokens are
                            returned
  shared-drives [options]   List accessible Google Shared Drives
  config                    Shared-style defaults/profile settings; credentials
                            are separate
  complete [words...]       Shell completion from the shared command registry
  schema <method>           Generated request schema and operation contract
                            without Google access
  models                    Configure the shared model gateway; keys stay
                            outside config
  mcp [options]             Expose guarded commands over MCP stdio
  commands [path...]        Discover the command tree and options as shared
                            registry data
  help [command]            display help for command

